ion.&nbsp; These bubbles burst, sending the whole market into a downward spiral, causing employers to lose capital and lay off employees.&nbsp; Consumer spending then plummeted and most businesses suffered.&nbsp; The economy is like a big boat, and once it gets moving quickly in the wrong direction, it’s hard to turn it around.&nbsp; </span></span></p>\n\n<p>4.&nbsp;What text structure was employed in this selection?</p>\n","ui_style":{"type":"horizontal","choice_label":"upper-alpha"},"response_id":"4fe1049c-085e-5a9f-ac8e-c006a4e6dfe2_51733f11b6649ec6a214c900e61a6236"},"response":{"value":["0"],"type":"array","apiVersion":"v2.173.24","revision":1},"creation_date":"2022-11-10 16:53:52","mod_date":"2022-11-10 16:54:10","persist_until":"2025-11-09 16:53:52","saved":true}]}